---
// 50 lags of pure noise. t-statistics are 50 draws from a standard normal (numpy default_rng(4)):
// 3 of 50 exceed |1.96| (lags 16, 30, 49); expected count 50 x 0.05 = 2.5; none exceed 3.29 (Bonferroni, 50 tests, two-sided 5%).
// Over 100,000 simulated sets of 50: mean count 2.49, P(at least one) 92.3%, P(any beyond 3.29) 4.9%.
const T = [-0.65, -0.17, 1.66, 0.66, -1.64, -0.01, -0.62, 0.15, -1.61, 0.24, 0.24, 1.58, 0.32, 0.51, -1.49, 2.25, -1.92, 1.1, -0.33, -0.88, -0.66, -0.67, 0.38, -0.11, 1.48, -1.83, -0.0, -0.89, 0.78, -2.12, -0.34, 0.21, -1.48, 0.99, 0.18, 1.01, 0.96, -0.98, -0.8, -0.2, 0.75, 0.85, -0.71, -0.61, -0.8, -0.58, -0.24, -0.13, 2.06, -0.51];
const X0 = 70, X1 = 880, YZ = 240, SC = 36;
const bw = (X1 - X0) / 50;
const y = (v: number) => YZ - v * SC;
---
<figure class="apnl">
  <div class="apnl-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 424" role="img" aria-label="Fifty bars of simulated t-statistics for 50 lags of pure noise. Three bars, at lags 16, 30 and 49, cross the dashed 1.96 lines. No bar crosses the solid 3.29 lines.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="apnl-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Fifty lags of pure noise still produce "significant" ones</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Năm mươi độ trễ toàn nhiễu vẫn cho ra vài cái "có ý nghĩa"</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="46" class="apnl-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Say each lag's t-statistic is a random draw with no signal behind it</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Giả sử t-statistic của mỗi độ trễ là một số ngẫu nhiên, không có tín hiệu nào phía sau</tspan>
    </text>
    {[1.96, -1.96].map((v) => <line x1={X0} x2={X1} y1={y(v)} y2={y(v)} class="apnl-ref" />)}
    {[3.29, -3.29].map((v) => <line x1={X0} x2={X1} y1={y(v)} y2={y(v)} class="apnl-hurdle" />)}
    <line x1={X0} x2={X1} y1={YZ} y2={YZ} class="apnl-axis" />
    {T.map((v, i) => (
      <rect x={X0 + i * bw + 2} y={v >= 0 ? y(v) : YZ} width={bw - 4} height={Math.max(1, Math.abs(v) * SC)} class={`apnl-bar ${Math.abs(v) > 1.96 ? 'is-hit' : ''}`} />
    ))}
    {[1, 10, 20, 30, 40, 50].map((l) => (
      <text x={X0 + (l - 1) * bw + bw / 2} y="392" text-anchor="middle" class="apnl-tick">{l}</text>
    ))}
    <text x={X0 + 405} y="414" text-anchor="middle" class="apnl-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>lag (weeks)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>độ trễ (tuần)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="62" y={y(1.96) + 4} text-anchor="end" class="apnl-tick">1.96</text>
    <text x="62" y={y(-1.96) + 4} text-anchor="end" class="apnl-tick">−1.96</text>
    <text x="62" y={y(3.29) + 4} text-anchor="end" class="apnl-tick is-red">3.29</text>
    <text x="62" y={y(-3.29) + 4} text-anchor="end" class="apnl-tick is-red">−3.29</text>
    <text x="690" y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="apnl-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3 of 50 cross 1.96 (50 × 5% = 2.5 expected)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3 trên 50 vượt 1,96 (kỳ vọng 50 × 5% = 2,5)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="690" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="apnl-note is-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>0 cross 3.29, the corrected bar for 50 tests</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>0 vượt 3,29, ngưỡng đã hiệu chỉnh cho 50 phép test</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>In 100,000 repeats of this experiment, at least one of the 50 lags crossed 1.96 in 92% of them, while only 5% had one beyond 3.29.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Lặp thí nghiệm này 100.000 lần, có ít nhất một trong 50 độ trễ vượt 1,96 ở 92% số lần, và chỉ 5% số lần có một độ trễ vượt 3,29.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .apnl { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .apnl-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .apnl svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .apnl text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .apnl .apnl-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .apnl .apnl-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .apnl .apnl-tick { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .apnl .apnl-tick.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .apnl .apnl-note { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .apnl .apnl-note.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .apnl-bar { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1; }
  .apnl-bar.is-hit { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .apnl-axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .apnl-ref { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .apnl-hurdle { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .apnl figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
